.TH CUMENT 1 "September 2026" "cument 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
cument \- your project's Markdown margin
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cument
[open|toggle|close|context|list|shell-init|doctor]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A native Markdown drawer for GNOME 50 on Wayland. Alt+bar toggles the drawer.
Enable cument@ryanraposo.github.io using gnome-extensions after installation.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B open [DIRECTORY]
Open the drawer in the given project (default: working directory).
.TP
.B toggle [DIRECTORY]
Toggle the drawer. With no command, cument toggles the working project.
.TP
.B close
Close the drawer and return focus to the previous application.
.TP
.B list [DIRECTORY] [--json]
List Markdown files, respecting Git ignore rules.
.TP
.B shell-init bash|zsh|fish
Print the shell hook. Evaluate it in the interactive shell configuration.
.TP
.B context [DIRECTORY] [--pid PID]
Publish shell context. Used by shell hooks.
.TP
.B doctor
Report the session, dependency and extension state.
.SH FILES
.I ~/.local/state/cument/recovery/
Recovery copies of documents whose save failed.
.SH AUTHOR
Ryan Raposo <raposo.ryan@gmail.com>
